OL,3,GNEWSAMPs write to Royal Mail over
OL,4,Amissed post complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Labour MPs have written an open
OL,7,Fletter to Royal Mail after numerous
OL,8,Fcomplaints from constituents about
OL,9,Fmissed post and deliveries.
OL,11,FMatt Rodda, Olivia Bailey and Yuan Yang
OL,12,F- who all represent constituencies in
OL,13,Fand around Reading in Berkshire - wrote
OL,14,Fthat many residents reported delays to
OL,15,Freceiving important documents and
OL,16,Fmissing "long-awaited health
OL,17,Fappointments".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
