OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1791203168
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMPs write to Royal Mail over
OL,4,Amissed post complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have been told that it is common
OL,7,Ffor constituents to get all post once a
OL,8,Fweek rather than regular deliveries,
OL,9,Fwith some reporting they are receiving
OL,10,Fpost fortnightly," they said.
OL,12,FRoyal Mail said delivery performance in
OL,13,FReading was improving and that it was
OL,14,Fmaking "significant changes across our
OL,15,Fnetwork".
